# Pairs with AppRulesSystemOriginOnly. Activation persists app rules inside a system-origin scope.
MODULE: AppsActivationWritesUserOrigin
TARGET: AppRulesSystemOriginOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: activation persists the app's rules outside the system-origin scope
PERTURBS: ActivateRules

--- FIND
    LET origin == "system"
--- REPLACE
    LET origin == "user"
--- END
